s GEOBIO-2022/2023/2024.json: CHEM 110 -> MATH 22 -> MATH 21 -> MATH 4 -> MATH 3 remedial chain added as explicit early items, identical fix. Same as those years (and unlike 2026-27), this year's real 'Select 3-4 credits' bio elective is still 'BIOL 230W, BIOL 240W, or MICRB 201' -- no BIOL 234/235W circular-prereq pair exists in the 2025-26 archive, so BIOL 230W is used directly. BIOL 220W (4cr, prereq only BIOL 110) is included as an explicit Prescribed Course (Year 2 Spring) per the Course List, same as GEOBIO-2022/2023/2024.json and same note that GEOBIO-2026.json's own semesters omit it despite the requirement being unchanged -- not corrected here, outside this file's scope. 'Advanced GEOBI elective' match regex and the BIOL 230W/MICRB 201/BIOL 240W single-credits-value caveat reused verbatim from GEOBIO-2022.json / GEOBIO-2026.json, same underlying Course List text.",
